The release builds QSMxT from immutable commit
999445010a067d9597299f217a9a1165d4b7d62d (upstream version 0.0.0),
with QSM.rs v0.40.0. Source and toolchain pins are in qsmxt.json.
The browser reference records exact revisions and measured compatibility.
The QSMxT 10.0.0 archive supplies only dcm2niix and its license;
its qsmxt executable is replaced by the source build.

QSMxT's archives include dcm2niix (https://github.com/rordenlab/dcm2niix);
its license is in app/native/dcm2niix.LICENSE.

Deep-learning weights are not included. They are downloaded on first use from
the Hugging Face repository qsmxt/qsm-onnx-weights at the commit pinned in
model.manifest.json; each model keeps its authors' license.
